# Allowlist for false positives surfaced by `gitleaks detect --no-git`
# in `.github/workflows/security-checks.yml` (job: secrets-scan).
#
# Each entry is a fingerprint emitted by gitleaks in the form
#   <file>:<rule-id>:<line>
#
# Re-evaluate every time the affected line is edited, since gitleaks
# matches on file+rule+line and a content change makes the suppression
# stale (and noisy in security reviews).
#
# Generic-API-Key heuristic flags the literal phrase "Ed25519-signed"
# in the doc comment that explains what a Trustalo Enterprise License
# token is. Entropy 3.52 — purely the hyphenated cryptography term, no
# secret material. Surrounding code references this exact wording, so
# rewording the comment would degrade docs without buying any safety.
packages/license/src/types.ts:generic-api-key:3
